This project involves extracting text from both handwritten and printed images using a combination of image segmentation, deep learning, and OCR techniques. 
We used Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN) for segmenting and recognizing characters, and integrated Tesseract OCR to enhance text extraction accuracy. 
The system was trained to process complex image inputs and achieved up to 92% accuracy in recognizing and extracting text.
The project was developed as part of our final-year major project, carried out in a team of three members who collaboratively handled model training, OCR integration, and performance testing.
